Structural and sequence data for the second target
--------------------------------------------------
BRD4 structures are from the RCSB Protein Data Bank, used under its terms of use
(https://www.rcsb.org/pages/usage-policy). Entries referenced: 4J3I (BRD4 BD1 with apabetalone /
RVX-208, 1.24 A) and 3MXF (BRD4 BD1 with (+)-JQ1). Sequence identity for the target is UniProt
O60885 (BRD4_HUMAN), used under CC BY 4.0 (https://www.uniprot.org/help/license).

Bound-ligand chemistry for reference compounds is from ChEMBL, under CC BY-SA 3.0, as recorded for
the primary bioactivity data above.
